lmbs[i].aa_index = be32_to_cpu(lmbs[i].aa_index);
```
Reason:
The `aa_index` (affinity value) was not being converted to match the endianness of the other properties in the 'ibm,dynamic-memory' attribute. This oversight could lead to the retrieval of non-existent nodes, as the `aa_index` would not align with the expected format, causing the system to potentially use default nodes inappropriately.

